# Frontend Conventions (electro-frontend)

## Key Dependencies
- `react@^19.2.0`, `react-router-dom@^7.9.5`
- `axios@^1.13.2` — HTTP client
- `three@^0.183.2` — 3D floor plan
- `@stomp/stompjs` + `sockjs-client` — WebSocket chat
- `recharts@^3.6.0` — admin charts
- `jspdf@^3.0.4` + `jspdf-autotable` — PDF export

## Component Rules
- Functional components + hooks only (no class components)
- Each major component in its own folder: `ComponentName/ComponentName.js` + `ComponentName.css`
- Styles: **separate .css files** next to component (no CSS Modules, no styled-components)
- `PascalCase` for component names and files; `camelCase` for variables, functions, props

## State Management
- `useState` / `useEffect` for local state
- `AuthContext` (via `useAuth()`) for global auth state only
- **No Redux / Zustand / MobX** — pass state via props and context

## Common UI Patterns
```js
// Modal
<Modal show={show} title="..." onClose={...} onConfirm={...} type="confirm" />

// Pagination
<Pagination currentPage={page} totalPages={total} onPageChange={setPage} />

// Forms: controlled inputs → submit → API → navigate
const [field, setField] = useState('');
const handleSubmit = async (e) => {
  e.preventDefault();
  try {
    await someAPI.create({ field });
    navigate('/somewhere');
  } catch (err) {
    setError(err.response?.data?.message || 'Ошибка');
  }
};

// Loading state
if (loading) return <div>Загрузка...</div>;
```

## API Layer (`src/api/api.js`)
- Single Axios instance; base URL from `src/utils/apiOrigin.js`
- Request interceptor: adds `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from `localStorage`
- Response interceptor: on `401` → clear localStorage + redirect to `/login`
- Import named modules: `authAPI`, `projectAPI`, `roomAPI`, `calculationAPI`, etc.

## Authentication (`useAuth()`)
```js
const { user, login, logout, hasRole, isAdmin, isDesigner } = useAuth();
```
- Token in `localStorage.token`, user in `localStorage.user`
- `ProtectedRoute` wraps all authenticated routes

## Routing
- `useNavigate()` for programmatic navigation
- `useParams()` for route params
- `<Link>` for JSX links
- Header hidden on `/login`, `/register`
- Fullscreen on `/projects/:id/floor-plan/3d`
